#: ../../modules/log.md:186 381064826d9e4dcfb243199e078480cc
msgid "🎓 How to Use?"
msgstr "🎓 如何使用？"

#: ../../modules/log.md:188 6e2eaba6a443414eb5d57fe6ea429595
msgid "Different log levels are available for various types of logs:"
msgstr "不同类型的日志有不同的日志级别："

#: ../../modules/log.md:189 f85ec4daf8a74c8dbe31eed27d182ca2
msgid "**Debug**: Detailed debug information."
msgstr "**调试**：详细的调试信息。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:190 9f9eac561dab43448618ae5fd2407742
msgid "**Information**: Interesting / significant events."
msgstr "**信息**：兴趣/重要事件。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:191 4ea8db7b99fd4fe2ba51e73b0b425c3e
msgid "**Warning**: Exceptional occurrences that are not errors."
msgstr "**警告**：不属于错误的异常情况。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:192 9df83f5eddb94847a073faa8d5de6b24
msgid "**Error**: Runtime errors that should be monitored and fixed."
msgstr "**错误**：应该监控和修复的运行时错误。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:196 64354d586e4a477a9d626be4bc88a409
msgid "Manage Granularity"
msgstr "管理日志粒度"

#: ../../modules/log.md:198 719679617d9a4e9da198491060ed2400
msgid "A significant number of logs can quickly flood the chat. To prevent this, Bookshelf's log module can be configured to display specific logs based on two parameters: the **log level**, the **tag** and the **namespace**."
msgstr "大量日志可能会迅速淹没聊天栏。为防止这种情况，Bookshelf 的日志模块可以根据三个参数配置显示特定日志：**日志级别**、**标签**和**命名空间**。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:200 88300f65c3114da7b26dbce975baa3a1
msgid "Users need to give themselves tags that follow a strict syntax: `<namespace>.log.<tag>.<level>`, where the level can be `debug`, `info`, `warn`, or `error`."
msgstr "用户需要给自己添加遵循严格语法的标签：`<命名空间>.log.<标签>.<级别>`，其中级别可以是 `debug`、`info`、`warn` 或 `error`。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:202 5b99a7811e474d04bbd8f46178eef947
msgid "The `_` symbol acts as a wildcard, logging all tags or all levels:"
msgstr "`_` 符号作为通配符，记录所有标签或所有级别："

#: ../../modules/log.md:203 971ea63eb2df436c957affb342e200e4
msgid "`bs.foo.log._.<level>`: show all logs of `bs.foo` regardless of the tag."
msgstr "`bs.foo.log._.<级别>`：显示 `bs.foo` 的所有日志，无论标签是什么。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:204 7d8d5c821e044dc7a783f899f0191232
msgid "`bs.foo.log.<tag>._`: show all logs of `bs.foo` regardless of the level."
msgstr "`bs.foo.log.<标签>._`：显示 `bs.foo` 的所有日志，无论级别是什么。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:205 efb2151ae65849b9a36d97c63e3d6c54
msgid "`bs.foo.log._._`: show all logs of `bs.foo`."
msgstr "`bs.foo.log._._`：显示 `bs.foo` 的所有日志。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:206 b722f5e801154e0ab858d6b632895d1f
msgid "`_.log._._`: show all logs."
msgstr "`_.log._._`：显示所有日志。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:209 0b02ac50de2e464a9238b17bef3f0a3f
msgid "Each level allows the visualization of subsequent levels. For example, if a user gives themselves a tag ending with warn, they can visualize logs of warn and error levels. By default, logs are not displayed to any user."
msgstr "每个级别允许显示后续级别。例如，如果用户给自己添加了以 warn 结尾的标签，他们就可以看到警告和错误级别的日志。默认情况下，不向任何用户显示日志。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:214 0fa8a8fb100c4a5784eb058afa427daa
msgid "Define the Message"
msgstr "定义消息"

#: ../../modules/log.md:216 cd86b82630c646c18d3018152c0d51dd
msgid "Log functions take four variables as input. The `path` of the current function that inform users of the log origin, the `tag`, the `namespace` and the `message`."
msgstr "日志函数接受四个变量作为输入。当前函数的 `path` 告知用户日志的来源，`tag`、`namespace` 和 `message`。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:219 464dd9fb096140878a48ad3caad85cae
msgid "The `message` string must be a valid SNBT text component. Thus, to specify a plain string text as a message, the message needs to be escaped  (`\"\\\"message\\\"\"` or `'\"message\"'`)."
msgstr "`message` 字符串必须是有效的 SNBT 文本组件。因此，要将纯文本字符串指定为消息，需要转义消息（`\"\\\"message\\\"\"` 或 `'\"message\"'`）。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:222 00e0d333b76243a993d65b6aeb7acd6e
msgid "*Example: Log a simple warning message. We assume the log originates from the `bs.foo:bar` function:*"
msgstr "*示例：记录简单的警告消息。我们假设日志来自 `bs.foo:bar` 函数：*"

#: ../../modules/log.md:228 2a9252160ae545909035bb2aa345b65b
msgid "Will display the following message if the user has one of these tags: `bs.foo.log.bar.warn`, `bs.foo.log.bar.info`, `bs.foo.log.bar.debug`, `bs.foo.log._.warn`, `bs.foo.log._.info`, `bs.foo.log._.debug`, `bs.foo.log._._`, `bs.foo.log.bar._`, `_.log.bar.warn`, `_.log.bar.info`, `_.log.bar.debug`, `_.log._.warn`, `_.log._.info`, `_.log._.debug`, `_.log._._`, `_.log.bar._`."
msgstr "如果用户具有以下标签之一，将显示以下消息：`bs.foo.log.bar.warn`、`bs.foo.log.bar.info`、`bs.foo.log.bar.debug`、`bs.foo.log._.warn`、`bs.foo.log._.info`、`bs.foo.log._.debug`、`bs.foo.log._._`、`bs.foo.log.bar._`、`_.log.bar.warn`、`_.log.bar.info`、`_.log.bar.debug`、`_.log._.warn`、`_.log._.info`、`_.log._.debug`、`_.log._._`、`_.log.bar._`。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:230 31658aff2f704b5993e87d5dfc213de5
msgid "![](/_imgs/modules/log/example-1.png)"
msgstr "![](/_imgs/modules/log/example-1.png)"

#: ../../modules/log.md:232 989045b7e40044d6ac5e5c19187b9f3e
msgid "*Example: Log a complex info message. We assume the log originates from the `bs.foo:baz` function:*"
msgstr "*示例：记录复杂的信息消息。我们假设日志来自 `bs.foo:baz` 函数：*"

#: ../../modules/log.md:238 a09fc6e00e664aaeaf155e8824058140
msgid "Will display the following message if the user has one of these tags: `bs.foo.log.baz.info`, `bs.foo.log.baz.debug`, `bs.foo.log._.info`, `bs.foo.log._.debug`, `bs.foo.log.baz._`, `_.log.baz.info`, `_.log.baz.debug`, `_.log._.info`, `_.log._.debug`, `_.log.baz._`."
msgstr "如果用户具有以下标签之一，将显示以下消息：`bs.foo.log.baz.info`、`bs.foo.log.baz.debug`、`bs.foo.log._.info`、`bs.foo.log._.debug`、`bs.foo.log.baz._`、`_.log.baz.info`、`_.log.baz.debug`、`_.log._.info`、`_.log._.debug`、`_.log.baz._`。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:240 1333870971004f49a8ee4580ffd519d0
msgid "![](/_imgs/modules/log/example-2.png)"
msgstr "![](/_imgs/modules/log/example-2.png)"

#: ../../modules/log.md:242 fa5d2735ad07406f9d6ead3ecf822df2
msgid "Customize the Format"
msgstr "自定义格式"

#: ../../modules/log.md:244 ee3281567fce43968f540c1e4fe44319
msgid "Bookshelf proposes to define different log message formats according to the namespace. To add new log message formats, you have to write directly inside the storage array `bs:const log.messages`:"
msgstr "Bookshelf 建议根据命名空间定义不同的日志消息格式。要添加新的日志消息格式，你必须直接写入命令存储数组 `bs:const log.messages`："

#: ../../modules/log.md:260 5f5785d0abd94ac0aa8925f43ffe8d02
msgid "The `namespaces` array stores all the namespaces sharing the same log message formats. The four formats (`error`, `warn`, `info` and `debug`) describe the log format for the respecting severity level. The value of each must be a full SNBT text component."
msgstr "`namespaces` 数组存储所有共享相同日志消息格式的命名空间。四种格式（`error`、`warn`、`info` 和 `debug`）描述了相应严重程度级别的日志格式。每个值必须是完整的 SNBT 文本组件。"

#: ../../modules/log.md:264 82beeacfb3404acaa18e8d12194357b4
msgid "Bookshelf exposes several values that can be used directly in the log messages format:"
msgstr "Bookshelf 提供了几个可以直接在日志消息格式中使用的值："

#: ../../modules/log.md:247 a8f015482fd444bf8f25217f3da097ba
msgid "storage"
msgstr "命令存储"

#: ../../modules/log.md:247 7e24c78be40142aba5ccdbb426dbcc9a
msgid "path"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../modules/log.md:247 700a8475a17846c1aee385783b2b0e77
msgid "description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../modules/log.md:247 1c43bff9b0de473dae7b6e45bb66bb0b
#: 2ea1a187aa6d4ec2abf0dc03bf93c918 5295a6f5203b41ad917a4e3e1d15f180
